{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":369053,\"title\":\"The Best Bad Man\",\"tagline\":\"As full of thrills as the dictionary is full of words.\",\"overview\":\"Visiting his vast properties incognito, Hugh Nichols (Tom Mix) discovers that his land agent (Cyril Chadwick) is forcing Peggy Swain (Clara Bow) and her dad (Frank Beal) off their neighboring ranch. When decent-minded Nichols demands that the agent cease harassing the farmers, the nasty villain blows up the nearby dam, flooding the valley.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2NEcOl3XxLD63BMXNiP3ykHkv7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8yAOZu7Jlv4WvMryMzjyGrajDrP.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1925,\"runtime\":50,\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"John G. Blystone\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":10516,\"name\":\"John G. Blystone\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/isOUSJrLtcqY5wlMd4997g8KJ9G.jpg\"},{\"id\":1052155,\"name\":\"Tom Mix\",\"character\":\"Hugh Nichols\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qTaMWapR1sxjk6mdi3tvRsSMNks.jpg\"},{\"id\":102499,\"name\":\"Clara Bow\",\"character\":\"Peggy Swain\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yYF0C0KBDVxcuiVwuW1uWxJeU8g.jpg\"},{\"id\":1053959,\"name\":\"Cyril Chadwick\",\"character\":\"Frank Dunlap\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/49tpBAMP8khe1Wor7sbDrBlRQyV.jpg\"},{\"id\":931793,\"name\":\"Paul Panzer\",\"character\":\"Sheriff\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6NhO8FSFg6azBGaga5IaSNaUNEs.jpg\"},{\"id\":1429298,\"name\":\"Judy King\",\"character\":\"Molly Jones\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/paXptCLlKK9jtKakKgwTmexyJxN.jpg\"},{\"id\":2671354,\"name\":\"Tony the Horse\",\"character\":\"Hugh's Horse\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2eOYsg7eXwlAixXqd1zfpOAQ5rq.jpg\"},{\"id\":1537614,\"name\":\"Buster Gardner\",\"character\":\"Hank Smith\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":34324,\"name\":\"Tom Kennedy\",\"character\":\"Dan Ellis\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/alBZz3yjAGTx6FJXwfHIgInX30W.jpg\"},{\"id\":1079152,\"name\":\"Frank Beal\",\"character\":\"Mr. Swain\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ylU8TQ2FKkFl6RQ9BFbL2Njanki.jpg\"},{\"id\":96061,\"name\":\"Tom Wilson\",\"character\":\"Sam\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wl63iKG9u51UY2dlULyramJhLnX.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":44896,\"title\":\"Rango\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A5MP1guV8pbruieG0tnpPIbaJtt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mOtKQlXdL5J4lwqcSFlkZmgmFeZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Rango, a lost family pet, accidentally winds up in the gritty, gun-slinging Western town of Dirt, the theater-loving lizard suddenly finds himself the newly appointed sheriff. Welcomed as the last hope the town has been waiting for, Rango is forced to play his new role to the hilt and uncover the truth behind a looming water crisis—before his act catches up with him.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":188161,\"title\":\"A Million Ways to Die in the West\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1fhAJzhzlaHYAPqiKZN5ap7d5PE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ZDM988DfYLFPBqy4CNvQ9AXnp4.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As a cowardly farmer begins to fall for the mysterious new woman in town, he must put his new-found courage to the test when her husband, a notorious gun-slinger, announces his arrival.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":537996,\"title\":\"The Ballad of Buster Scruggs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/voxl654m7p36y8FLu8oQD7dfwwK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/12RXkIWUXwOHXgAmlxJNIWRGrri.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Vignettes weaving together the stories of six individuals in the old West at the end of the Civil War. Following the tales of a sharp-shooting songster, a wannabe bank robber, two weary traveling performers, a lone gold prospector, a woman traveling the West to an uncertain future, and a motley crew of strangers undertaking a carriage ride.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8584,\"title\":\"Shanghai Noon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b0WwWRcDiDahkah5vZ0KjB4N9ZZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xuwPmDMHslcx71T7zHc9YqF2Ny3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Chon Wang, a clumsy imperial guard, trails Princess Pei Pei when she's kidnapped from the Forbidden City and transported to America. Wang follows her captors to Nevada, where he teams up with an unlikely partner, outcast outlaw Roy O'Bannon, and tries to spring the princess from her imprisonment.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":52629,\"title\":\"El Infierno\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ar8BpJ5xAzTIw9bqD9Sra6TjBvw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bQObbnj0TY2Q1c55w78m1AN6VNX.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being deported back to Mexico, a man has no choice but to join the vicious drug cartel that has corrupted his hometown in order to survive.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":648878,\"title\":\"Eddington\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4GIqZUgPZ146BhibsPHMHef2nXX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/znr3SYHph3FtTLpcFTeuMAAJ5mP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In May of 2020, a standoff between a small-town sheriff and mayor sparks a powder keg as neighbor is pitted against neighbor in Eddington, New Mexico.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":440161,\"title\":\"The Sisters Brothers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wTgomqYRTXT3BXQScnIo8uHDyWC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2cI0rmMgoZOqP78iQDZwQASkKT3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Oregon, 1851. Hermann Kermit Warm, a chemist and aspiring gold prospector, keeps a profitable secret that the Commodore wants to know, so he sends the Sisters brothers, two notorious assassins, to capture him on his way to California.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6038,\"title\":\"Shanghai Knights\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vVNQStMlZS9mn2AKBEpadRunHgt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AoXqOWzD0HGZttYi0wHMvvGJZhZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a Chinese rebel murders Chon's estranged father and escapes to England, Chon and Roy make their way to London with revenge on their minds.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1969,\"title\":\"Bandidas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/31wgXG6OxDaXbp5IzyNoUJdVS5e.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vmDpLofmDgDx3KXTNzRc6dYROim.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a ruthless robber baron takes away everything they cherish, a rough-and-tumble, idealistic peasant and a sophisticated heiress embark on a quest for justice, vengeance…and a few good heists.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":347969,\"title\":\"The Ridiculous 6\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kPc80jywR5Nm2KIQjkY5i4VXSx4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cB9XLza46oXuBtfuEUktThmQf6F.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When his long-lost outlaw father returns, Tommy \\\"White Knife\\\" Stockburn goes on an adventure-filled journey across the Old West with his five brothers.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":934456,\"title\":\"Americana\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/83Gis9pOKCvAdaKXCNChey4IZyL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ice3dNrgJZmyFXs4InhjAJMIGMS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a rare Native American artifact falls onto the black market, a shy waitress with big dreams teams up with a lovelorn military veteran to gain possession of it, putting them in the crosshairs of a ruthless criminal working on behalf of a Western antiquities dealer.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Western\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15067,\"title\":\"The Good, the Bad, the Weird\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lbPZ0aNoF0cHisg6DubFO2eS8so.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gec3e76TRGUBx1Ut0c6yuSahVDp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of three Korean outlaws in 1930s Manchuria and their dealings with the Japanese army and Chinese and Russian bandits. The Good (a bounty hunter), the Bad (a hitman), and the Weird (a thief) battle the army and the bandits in a race to use a treasure map to uncover the riches of legend.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"V8_vSC0MCfc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"oSFwcK9YeZM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"UjB94MMgjN0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}